Unibus/Omnibus Tranceiver, extended single
<UL>
<LI><b>M785B</b> needs a drawing.</LI>
<LI><b>M785dec</b> is an Eagle drawing of DEC's M785 Unibus/Omnibus Tranceiver board
using the hard to find DS8881 and SP380 chips..</LI>
<LI><b>M785</b>  is a version of DEC's M785 Unibus/Omnibus Tranceiver board with the
hard to find chips replaced with AM26S10.</LI>
<LI><b>M785-3116</b> is a version of DEC's M785 Unibus/Omnibus Tranceiver board with the
hard to find chips replaced with 7438 and the (too) expensive TL3116.</LI>
